GooglePhotosFS implements the Google Photos mobile protocol and the behavior
of rclone-gphotos-oot (akhil-rana, 1ee56f51), with the native WinFsp mounting
pattern of TelegramFS (tizianoluziramos, 9e76dfa1). Their repositories are
the functional references. This distribution uses Go, go-winfsp, SQLite,
and the additional dependencies identified in go.mod and licenses/.

WinFsp - Windows File System Proxy, Copyright (C) Bill Zissimopoulos.
The WinFsp driver is installed separately.
https://github.com/winfsp/winfsp
